    {
      "Id": 2005703011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，不好意思。/n我们现在正在备菜，请稍后再……初魅！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我回来了，爸爸。/n应该是上次来办庆功宴以后第一次吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "怎么了，爸爸？/n哎呀，初魅。今天没有和同一台戏的人一起来吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，这个嘛……今天不是来办庆功宴的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 24,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊……一直站在那里也不是个事。/n进来吧。得等备菜结束以后才能陪你聊……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "SeFileName": "830",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue2": 0.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.30000001192092896
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，没关系。/n倒不如说，是我突然回来占用了你们的时间，抱歉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这是……金枪鱼赤身、炖菜。/n居然连酒都有。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们不是还在备菜吗？/n不用这么特意照顾我的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "顺手而已，顺手。再说女儿都回来了，/n给她准备顿晚饭不是应该的吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "爸爸嘴上说是顺手，/n其实刚才做得可起劲了哦～？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "妈妈。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵，哈哈哈！/n谢谢你，爸爸。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我开动了。/n嚼嚼，吸溜……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，好吃。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是吗，那就好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，做了也算值得。/n所以……公演，顺利吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没问题，似乎评价很好。/n我自己也做出了想做的舞台，对成果很满意。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊。没有太沉迷舞台，把自己逼得太狠吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没有乱来。我也有注意身体。/n毕竟不能在追随我的人面前露出没出息的一面！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030270",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是上次来这里办庆功宴时带来的那些孩子吧。/n看起来都是好孩子。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，作为同一个剧团的伙伴，很可靠。/n实际上，和她们在一起，我也经常能意识到很多事情。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030290",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵，爸爸那天可是放下心来了哦？/n觉得你确实有好好在做。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "剧团创始人特特拉也会给我一些建议，/n总体上都很顺利。不用担心。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "说起来，妈妈。/n我的相册可以借我一下吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可以啊，怎么了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005703037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005703,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没什么……只是突然想久违地翻翻。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057030340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
